{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32651","headline":"江楼月夜闻笛 · 刘沧","name":"江楼月夜闻笛","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"南浦蒹葭疎雨後，寂寥横笛怨江楼。\n思飘明月浪花白，声入碧云枫叶秋。\n河汉夜阑孤鴈度，潇湘水阔二妃愁。\n髪寒衣湿曲初罢，露色河光生钓舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32651.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32651","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}